  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "fe3e1e70-0908-460b-9354-4ac8f0dac698",
      "title": "Observe a frase, escute o áudio e ligue o espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c5618db2-cd0e-44ac-a26e-cbff121f82ef",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a devolução curta da conversa.</p><p><strong>¿Y tú?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>E você?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fd08a77092204f2b867c9ba6bff18565_l02b01-y-tu.png?Expires=1794099389&Signature=Ra-lg0Vefo7LrVKg8tJUXDy53cDVN0zCabNaYnk5vCyjQnnc4~IqB6hImgaPSMeN3qOS4UAp-a4GIkGWrgmUcW7LHD4WLskJ0IGvP6ZGdoI90O-4SOb-q0mCL5PPhnPgdYiS5CGbcEGPDqmS-9L2j6IQ1O4XMRcdym35a3tbpdz0uB7yK9md0SkQDhPCDczF2-YAGzVn1QKBEozKJ11sfE0IkzDbd4e4637OtCeJXTKbqsgNEU55vkm6npbww9lHzv9iA7AXxCji0xiUp6bpSdknnsvAqbRwt3CFdKiumZat0iWPe2g6TyUPohjFje4mgz~XSzgmsa4CcOVx2otqyA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
